Delivered. Two files, zero dependencies.

**`cache.go`** — `sync.RWMutex`-protected LRU using `container/list` + `map[string]*list.Element`. O(1) Get/Put. Exact API per spec.

**`cache_test.go`** — 11 tests + 2 benchmarks.

